menu "Pajoniiir Wi-Fi diagnostics"
config WIFI_LINK_DIAGNOSTIC_LOW_TX_POWER
    bool "Limit SoftAP TX power to 2 dBm for S2 coexistence comparison"
    depends on PAJONIIIR_BOARD_M3 && CONTROLLER_USB_HS_AUDIO_DIAGNOSTIC
    default n
    help
        Bench-only comparison. After AP_START, set and read back an 8-quarter-dBm
        maximum. The earliest startup transmissions are not covered. Normal
        builds retain the C6 default. Does not change SDIO or USB timing.
endmenu
